 "summary": "A single silicon small-signal diode for general switching, in the axial glass DO-35 (DO-204AH) package. It blocks 75 V working (100 V repetitive peak), carries 300 mA continuous forward current, and recovers in 4 ns or less. 1N914-TR is the part on 14-inch tape and reel; 1N914TAP is the same part in an ammopack.",
